{"complete_extracted_copy":false,"coverage":"improved-source","entries":{"social-security-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.2.answer":{"context":"social-security-calculator UI copy.additionalFaqs.2.answer","source_hash":"360605da5d39b8a3a25c93b8ad5b0ca1d1fd1816884cd2e45a822be134d42391","translation":"Ndiyo. Kwa 2025-2026 umri-62 cohorts, makadirio haya hutumia umri kamili ya kustaafu ya 67, SSA ya mapema-dai kupunguza formula, na kuahirishwa mikopo ya kustaafu ya theluthi mbili ya 1% kwa mwezi kupitia umri 70. Faida halisi inaweza kuwa ni pamoja na marekebisho mengine."},"social-security-calculator.copy.fields.estimateOnly":{"context":"social-security-calculator UI copy.fields.estimateOnly","source_hash":"10b7141dcd1652e32b02bf1b2d445fdbb5860cd67362820d6dcc6d3a79f3c284","translation":"Hii ni makadirio rahisi, si tuzo au ahadi ya malipo. Inatumia rasmi 2025 / 2026 PIA formula na anadhani umri kamili ya kustaafu ya 67. Haihesabu AIME kutoka mishahara, kuongeza baadaye COLAs, kuthibitisha mikopo ya kazi au mapato, au mfano wa kodi, premiums Medicare, faida ya familia, ulemavu au faida survivor. Angalia kauli yako rasmi ya Kijamii ya Usalama na kutumia SSA ya estimator kwa ajili ya makadirio binafsi. Hii zana inatoa taarifa ya jumla, si ushauri wa kifedha."},"social-security-calculator.copy.howTo.1":{"context":"social-security-calculator UI copy.howTo.1","source_hash":"dbe1604e30185744fd24c437fddb7ac5dc9ff88cb7010ee587213ecc8990ca70","translation":"Chagua mwaka ulipogeuka 62 na ingia AIME ya dola nzima iliyoonyeshwa na SSA."},"social-security-calculator.copy.intro":{"context":"Shared UI copy.intro","source_hash":"ba22b570174c2ab9fae09ea5bfe222ed4021e58e65c38627273fdb366ee32e44","translation":"Makadirio ya faida ya kustaafu-mfanyakazi kwa kutumia wastani wako indexed mapato ya kila mwezi (AIME), mwaka uligeuka 62, na madai ya umri kutoka 62 kwa 70. Hii rahisi makadirio haipati rekodi yako ya Kijamii ya Usalama."}},"locale":"sw","missing":["social-security-calculator.copy.na